      "claim": "The game pushes in-app purchases through the Marketplace using Minecoins.",
      "stance": "risk",
      "quote": "a hub of purchasable maps, skins, and mini-games bought with the currency Minecoins, all of which are curated to ensure quality and safety."
    },
    {
      "ref": "[D532]",
      "area": "data",
